    },
    "This name applies to every %@ segment in exports." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dieser Name gilt für jedes %@-Segment in Exporten."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"This name applies to every %@ segment in exports."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Este nombre se aplica a cada segmento %@ en las exportaciones."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ce nom s’applique à chaque segment %@ dans les exportations."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Questo nome si applica a ogni segmento %@ nelle esportazioni."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"この名前はエクスポート内のすべての %@ セグメントに適用されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 이름은 내보낸 모든 %@ 세그먼트에 적용됩니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Este nome se aplica a cada segmento %@ nas exportações."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Это имя применяется к каждому сегменту %@ в экспортах."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此名称适用于导出内容中的每个 %@ 片段。"}}}},
    "Planned Model" : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Geplantes Modell"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Planned Model"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Modelo previsto"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Modèle prévu"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Modello previsto"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"予定モデル"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"예정 모델"}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Modelo previsto"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Планируемая модель"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"计划模型"}}}},
    "Play this segment from the source audio." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Spielen Sie diesen Abschnitt aus dem Quellton ab."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Play this segment from the source audio."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reproduzca este segmento desde el audio de origen."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jouez ce segment à partir de l’audio source."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Riproduci questo segmento dall'audio sorgente."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"このセグメントをソースオーディオから再生します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"이 세그먼트를 소스 오디오에서 재생합니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reproduza este segmento a partir do áudio de origem."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Воспроизведите этот сегмент из исходного звука."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"从源音频播放此片段。"}}}},
    "Codex receives bounded transcript text, the active profile's full glossary and its hash, post-processing instructions, and the target language when translating. Audio and source artifacts stay on this Mac unchanged." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex erhält begrenzten Transkripttext, das vollständige Glossar des aktiven Profils samt Hash, Nachbearbeitungsanweisungen und beim Übersetzen die Zielsprache. Audio und Quellartefakte bleiben unverändert auf diesem Mac."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Codex receives bounded transcript text, the active profile's full glossary and its hash, post-processing instructions, and the target language when translating. Audio and source artifacts stay on this Mac unchanged."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex recibe texto de transcripción limitado, el glosario completo del perfil activo y su hash, instrucciones de posprocesamiento y, al traducir, el idioma de destino. El audio y los artefactos de origen permanecen sin cambios en este Mac."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex reçoit du texte de transcription limité, le glossaire complet du profil actif et son hachage, les instructions de post-traitement et, lors d’une traduction, la langue cible. L’audio et les artefacts source restent inchangés sur ce Mac."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Codex riceve testo della trascrizione limitato, l'intero glossario del profilo attivo e il suo hash, le istruzioni di post-processing e, in caso di traduzione, la lingua di destinazione. L'audio e gli artefatti sorgente rimangono invariati su questo Mac."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex は、上限を設けたトランスクリプトのテキスト、アクティブなプロフィールの用語集全体とそのハッシュ、後処理の指示、翻訳時には翻訳先の言語を受け取ります。音声とソースアーティファクトは変更されずにこの Mac に残ります。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Codex는 범위를 제한한 전사문 텍스트, 활성 프로필의 용어집 전체와 그 해시, 후처리 지침, 번역할 때는 대상 언어를 받습니다. 오디오와 원본 아티팩트는 변경되지 않은 채 이 Mac에 남습니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O Codex recebe texto de transcrição limitado, o glossário completo do perfil ativo e seu hash, instruções de pós-processamento e, ao traduzir, o idioma de destino. O áudio e os artefatos de origem permanecem inalterados neste Mac."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex получает ограниченный текст расшифровки, полный глоссарий активного профиля и его хеш, инструкции по постобработке и, при переводе, целевой язык. Аудио и исходные артефакты остаются на этом Mac без изменений."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex 接收受限的转录文本、当前配置文件的完整术语表及其哈希、后处理说明，以及翻译时的目标语言。音频和源产物保持不变并留在这台 Mac 上。"}}}},
    "A new setup selects Codex only when its CLI is signed in; otherwise it selects Local. Codex receives bounded transcript text, the active profile's full glossary and its hash, post-processing instructions, and the target language when translating. Audio never leaves this Mac." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bei einer neuen Einrichtung wird Codex nur ausgewählt, wenn die CLI angemeldet ist; andernfalls wird Local ausgewählt. Codex erhält begrenzten Transkripttext, das vollständige Glossar des aktiven Profils samt Hash, Nachbearbeitungsanweisungen und beim Übersetzen die Zielsprache. Audio verlässt diesen Mac nie."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"A new setup selects Codex only when its CLI is signed in; otherwise it selects Local. Codex receives bounded transcript text, the active profile's full glossary and its hash, post-processing instructions, and the target language when translating. Audio never leaves this Mac."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Una configuración nueva selecciona Codex solo si su CLI ha iniciado sesión; de lo contrario selecciona Local. Codex recibe texto de transcripción limitado, el glosario completo del perfil activo y su hash, instrucciones de posprocesamiento y, al traducir, el idioma de destino. El audio nunca sale de este Mac."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Une nouvelle configuration sélectionne Codex uniquement si son CLI est connecté; sinon elle sélectionne Local. Codex reçoit du texte de transcription limité, le glossaire complet du profil actif et son hachage, les instructions de post-traitement et, lors d’une traduction, la langue cible. L’audio ne quitte jamais ce Mac."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Una nuova configurazione seleziona Codex solo se la sua CLI ha effettuato l'accesso; altrimenti seleziona Local. Codex riceve testo della trascrizione limitato, l'intero glossario del profilo attivo e il suo hash, le istruzioni di post-processing e, in caso di traduzione, la lingua di destinazione. L'audio non lascia mai questo Mac."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"新しい設定では、CLI にサインインしている場合にのみ Codex が選択されます。そうでない場合は Local が選択されます。Codex は、上限を設けたトランスクリプトのテキスト、アクティブなプロフィールの用語集全体とそのハッシュ、後処理の指示、翻訳時には翻訳先の言語を受け取ります。音声がこの Mac から出ることはありません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"새로 설정하면 Codex CLI에 로그인한 경우에만 Codex를 선택합니다. 그렇지 않으면 Local을 선택합니다. Codex는 범위를 제한한 전사문 텍스트, 활성 프로필의 용어집 전체와 그 해시, 후처리 지침, 번역할 때는 대상 언어를 받습니다. 오디오는 이 Mac을 떠나지 않습니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uma nova configuração seleciona Codex somente quando a CLI está autenticada; caso contrário, seleciona Local. O Codex recebe texto de transcrição limitado, o glossário completo do perfil ativo e seu hash, instruções de pós-processamento e, ao traduzir, o idioma de destino. O áudio nunca sai deste Mac."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Новая настройка выбирает Codex только при входе в CLI; иначе выбирается Local. Codex получает ограниченный текст расшифровки, полный глоссарий активного профиля и его хеш, инструкции по постобработке и, при переводе, целевой язык. Аудио никогда не покидает этот Mac."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"新设置仅在 Codex CLI 已登录时选择 Codex；否则选择 Local。Codex 接收受限的转录文本、当前配置文件的完整术语表及其哈希、后处理说明，以及翻译时的目标语言。音频绝不会离开这台 Mac。"}}}},
    "Audio stays on this Mac. Transcription runs locally; during post-processing Codex receives bounded transcript text, the active profile's full glossary and its hash, post-processing instructions, and the target language when translating." : {"localizations":{"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Audio bleibt auf diesem Mac. Die Transkription läuft lokal; während der Nachbearbeitung erhält Codex begrenzten Transkripttext, das vollständige Glossar des aktiven Profils samt Hash, Nachbearbeitungsanweisungen und beim Übersetzen die Zielsprache."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"Audio stays on this Mac. Transcription runs locally; during post-processing Codex receives bounded transcript text, the active profile's full glossary and its hash, post-processing instructions, and the target language when translating."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"El audio permanece en este Mac. La transcripción se ejecuta localmente; durante el posprocesamiento Codex recibe texto de transcripción limitado, el glosario completo del perfil activo y su hash, instrucciones de posprocesamiento y, al traducir, el idioma de destino."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"L’audio reste sur ce Mac. La transcription s’exécute localement; lors du post-traitement, Codex reçoit du texte de transcription limité, le glossaire complet du profil actif et son hachage, les instructions de post-traitement et, lors d’une traduction, la langue cible."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"L'audio resta su questo Mac. La trascrizione viene eseguita localmente; durante il post-processing Codex riceve testo della trascrizione limitato, l'intero glossario del profilo attivo e il suo hash, le istruzioni di post-processing e, in caso di traduzione, la lingua di destinazione."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"音声はこの Mac にとどまります。文字起こしはローカルで実行され、後処理中に Codex は上限を設けたトランスクリプトのテキスト、アクティブなプロフィールの用語集全体とそのハッシュ、後処理の指示、翻訳時には翻訳先の言語を受け取ります。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"needs_review","value":"오디오는 이 Mac에 남습니다. 전사는 로컬에서 실행되며 후처리할 때 Codex는 범위를 제한한 전사문 텍스트, 활성 프로필의 용어집 전체와 그 해시, 후처리 지침, 번역할 때는 대상 언어를 받습니다."}},"pt":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O áudio permanece neste Mac. A transcrição é executada localmente; durante o pós-processamento, o Codex recebe texto de transcrição limitado, o glossário completo do perfil ativo e seu hash, instruções de pós-processamento e, ao traduzir, o idioma de destino."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Аудио остаётся на этом Mac. Расшифровка выполняется локально; во время постобработки Codex получает ограниченный текст расшифровки, полный глоссарий активного профиля и его хеш, инструкции по постобработке и, при переводе, целевой язык."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"音频保留在这台 Mac 上。转录在本地运行；后处理期间 Codex 接收受限的转录文本、当前配置文件的完整术语表及其哈希、后处理说明，以及翻译时的目标语言。"}}}}
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
